        "biography": "Ashley Hudson is known stunt doubling for actresses Anna Kendrick, Melissa Leo, and the late Brittany Murphy. Her stunt career allowed her opportunities to work on blockbuster films such as Furious 7 (2015), Terminator Genisys (2015), Olympus Has Fallen (2013), Dawn of the Planet of the Apes (2014), Green Lantern (2011), and with Anna Kendrick on The Accountant (2016) opposite Ben Affleck.\n\nHudson's commitment to the industry has brought her experiences in all aspects of film production such as writing and directing and has allowed her to study from some top directors. She attributes her career accomplishments to her hard work, dedication, and love of film.",
